  "question": {
    "html": "<p>What is a correct expression for the energy released during the neutron-induced fission of uranium-235 into barium-144 and krypton-89?</p>\n<p> </p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"( m_{\\textup{U}} - m_{\\textup{Ba}} - m_{\\textup{Kr}})c^{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"( m_{\\textup{U}} - m_{\\textup{Ba}} - m_{\\textup{Kr}}- m_{n})c^{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"( m_{\\textup{U}} - m_{\\textup{Ba}} - m_{\\textup{Kr}}- 2m_{n})c^{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"( m_{\\textup{U}} - m_{\\textup{Ba}} - m_{\\textup{Kr}}- 3m_{n})c^{2}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
